{
  "esm": "2.4.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "heat_column_varcoeff_value_bc",
    "description": "MMS driver for grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc (conservative finite-volume diffusion with an interface-valued coefficient and supplied boundary VALUES): u_t = d/dz(K du/dz) + S(z,t) on the unit column [0, 1], discretized on the grid's shared quadratic-stretch MMS column, with the GENUINELY VARIABLE interface coefficient K(z) = 1 + z (K[kn] = 1 + ze[kn]). Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-t) (1 + z + sin(pi z)) (the model-local template value_bc_mms_exact): u_z = exp(-t) (1 + pi cos(pi z)), so K u_z = exp(-t) (1+z) (1 + pi cos(pi z)), whose z-derivative is exp(-t) [ 1 + pi cos(pi z) - pi^2 (1+z) sin(pi z) ], and u_t = -u; the forcing that makes u exact is S(z,t) = exp(-t) [ -2 - z - sin(pi z) - pi cos(pi z) + pi^2 (1+z) sin(pi z) ] (value_bc_mms_forcing), evaluated at the RUNTIME layer centres zc. The rule's free names are tied to the solution in the model: the face coordinates z_sfc = 0 and z_top = 1 are parameters and the boundary values are the observeds u_sfc = value_bc_mms_exact(z_sfc, t) = exp(-t) and u_top = value_bc_mms_exact(z_top, t) = 2 exp(-t). The problem is chosen so that an index or orientation slip in the rule cannot hide: the two boundary values differ (1 vs 2, so swapping u_sfc and u_top is an O(1) error); the two face fluxes K u_z are nonzero and unequal ((1 + pi) exp(-t) at the surface, 2 (1 - pi) exp(-t) at the top) and the face coefficients differ (K = 1 vs 2), so reading K[2] for K[1] or K[NLEV] for K[NLEV+1], or zc[2] for zc[1], changes a nonzero face flux by O(1) relative; and nothing is discretely exact, so the t = 0.1 error is the full spatial error of the scheme, half-cell one-sided boundary closure included. The mesh follows the grid's edge-array contract (ze = the shared mms_column_ze of grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column.esm; zc and dz grid-derived). The ic applies the closed per-layer centre template mms_column_zc (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column_centre.esm) inside an aggregate over lev; the 6.6.5 test references spell the layer centre inline from literals and NLEV, because the inline-test oracle does not resolve template references.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:problem",
      "grid:column_nonuniform_1d",
      "equation:heat",
      "mms"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Roache, P. J. (2002). Code verification by the method of manufactured solutions. J. Fluids Eng. 124(1), 4-10.",
        "doi": "10.1115/1.1436090"
      }
    ]
  },
  "models": {
    "Heat": {
      "operator_imports": [
        { "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d/rules/varcoeff_face_laplacian_lev_value_bc.esm" },
        { "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column.esm" },
        { "ref": "../grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column_centre.esm" }
      ],
      "operators": {
        "value_bc_mms_exact": {
          "params": ["z", "t"],
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-t) (1 + z + sin(pi z)).",
          "body": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["t"] }] },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  1.0,
                  "z",
                  { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "value_bc_mms_forcing": {
          "params": ["z", "t"],
          "description": "Manufactured forcing S(z,t) = u_t - d/dz((1+z) u_z) = exp(-t) [ -2 - z - sin(pi z) - pi cos(pi z) + pi^2 (1+z) sin(pi z) ].",
          "body": {
            "op": "*",
            "args": [
              { "op": "exp", "args": [{ "op": "-", "args": ["t"] }] },
              {
                "op": "+",
                "args": [
                  -2.0,
                  { "op": "-", "args": ["z"] },
                  { "op": "-", "args": [{ "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }] },
                  {
                    "op": "-",
                    "args": [
                      { "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, { "op": "cos", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }] }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "op": "*",
                    "args": [
                      9.869604401089358,
                      { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "z"] },
                      { "op": "sin", "args": [{ "op": "*", "args": [3.141592653589793, "z"] }] }
                    ]
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "variables": {
        "u": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Temperature over the lev (layer) axis."
        },
        "K": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m^2/s",
          "shape": ["lev_nodes"],
          "description": "Interface diffusivity K = 1 + z evaluated on the interfaces, K[kn] = 1 + ze[kn] (1 at the surface face, 2 at the top face)."
        },
        "S": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K/s",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Manufactured forcing value_bc_mms_forcing(zc, t)."
        },
        "u_sfc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "description": "Boundary value of u on the surface face (the rule's free name): the manufactured solution at z_sfc, exp(-t)."
        },
        "u_top": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "K",
          "description": "Boundary value of u on the top face (the rule's free name): the manufactured solution at z_top, 2 exp(-t)."
        },
        "z_sfc": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 0.0,
          "description": "Surface-face coordinate (the rule's free name), ze[1] = 0 on the unit column."
        },
        "z_top": {
          "type": "parameter",
          "units": "m",
          "default": 1.0,
          "description": "Top-face coordinate (the rule's free name), ze[NLEV+1] = 1 on the unit column."
        },
        "ze": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev_nodes"],
          "description": "Interface coordinates of the quadratic-stretch column, the grid's shared MMS test column mms_column_ze (grids/column_nonuniform_1d/mesh/mms_column.esm): ze[kn] = 0.6 ((kn-1)/NLEV) + 0.4 ((kn-1)/NLEV)^2 for kn = 1..NLEV+1."
        },
        "zc": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Layer centres, GRID-DERIVED from ze by applying grids/column_nonuniform_1d column_cell_center. Read by the rule by bare name."
        },
        "dz": {
          "type": "unknown",
          "units": "m",
          "shape": ["lev"],
          "description": "Layer thicknesses, GRID-DERIVED from ze by applying column_cell_thickness. The finite-volume measure read by the rule by bare name."
        }
      },
      "equations": [
        {
          "lhs": { "op": "ic", "args": ["u"] },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i"],
            "args": [],
            "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_operator",
              "args": [],
              "name": "value_bc_mms_exact",
              "bindings": {
                "z": {
                  "op": "apply_operator",
                  "args": [],
                  "name": "mms_column_zc",
                  "bindings": { "i": "i" }
                },
                "t": 0.0
              }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": { "op": "D", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "t" },
          "rhs": {
            "op": "+",
            "args": [
              {
                "op": "partial",
                "args": [
                  { "op": "*", "args": ["K", { "op": "partial", "args": ["u"], "wrt": "lev" }] }
                ],
                "wrt": "lev"
              },
              "S"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "K",
          "rhs": { "op": "+", "args": [1.0, "ze"] }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "S",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "faq",
            "output_idx": ["i"],
            "args": ["zc"],
            "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" } },
            "expr": {
              "op": "apply_operator",
              "args": [],
              "name": "value_bc_mms_forcing",
              "bindings": { "z": { "op": "index", "args": ["zc", "i"] }, "t": "t" }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "u_sfc",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_operator",
            "args": [],
            "name": "value_bc_mms_exact",
            "bindings": { "z": "z_sfc", "t": "t" }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "u_top",
          "rhs": {
            "op": "apply_operator",
            "args": [],
            "name": "value_bc_mms_exact",
            "bindings": { "z": "z_top", "t": "t" }
          }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "ze",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_operator", "args": [], "name": "mms_column_ze", "bindings": {} }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "zc",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_operator", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_center", "bindings": { "ze": "ze" } }
        },
        {
          "lhs": "dz",
          "rhs": { "op": "apply_operator", "args": [], "name": "column_cell_thickness", "bindings": { "ze": "ze" } }
        }
      ],
      "tests": [
        {
          "id": "mms_column_variable_k_value_bc",
          "description": "Manufactured solution u(z,t) = exp(-t) (1 + z + sin(pi z)) with K = 1 + z on the interfaces, the matching forcing S, and the boundary values u_sfc = exp(-t), u_top = 2 exp(-t) on the quadratic-stretch column. The t=0 assertion pins the ic wiring; the t=0.1 assertion bounds the L2 error at the default NLEV = 64 (second-order; per-resolution values pinned in tests/conformance/convergence/heat_column_varcoeff_value_bc/golden/errors.json).",
          "time_span": { "start": 0.0, "end": 0.1 },
          "assertions": [
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.0,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": { "abs": 1e-09 },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "faq",
                "output_idx": ["i"],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" } },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    1.0,
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        1.0,
                        {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]},
                        {
                          "op": "sin",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            {
              "variable": "u",
              "time": 0.1,
              "expected": 0.0,
              "tolerance": { "abs": 0.000125 },
              "reduce": "L2_error",
              "reference": {
                "op": "faq",
                "output_idx": ["i"],
                "args": [],
                "ranges": { "i": { "from": "lev" } },
                "expr": {
                  "op": "*",
                  "args": [
                    0.9048374180359595,
                    {
                      "op": "+",
                      "args": [
                        1.0,
                        {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]},
                        {
                          "op": "sin",
                          "args": [
                            {
                              "op": "*",
                              "args": [
                                3.141592653589793,
                                {"op": "*", "args": [0.5, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": [{"op": "-", "args": ["i", 1]}, "NLEV"]}]}]}, {"op": "+", "args": [{"op": "*", "args": [0.6, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}, {"op": "*", "args": [0.4, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}, {"op": "/", "args": ["i", "NLEV"]}]}]}]}]}
                              ]
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
